[Vocab] オス

20
00:02:26,788 --> 00:02:29,116
[Host] It means male, for animals.

21
00:02:29,716 --> 00:02:40,108
[Slow] マックは、1995年3月に、スイスから王子動物園に来ました。

22
00:02:40,907 --> 00:02:45,587
[Host] Mac came to Oji Zoo from Switzerland in March of nineteen ninety-five.

23
00:02:46,187 --> 00:02:48,276
[Vocab] 来る

24
00:02:48,675 --> 00:02:50,764
[Host] It means to come.

25
00:02:51,364 --> 00:03:01,924
[Slow] その年の1月、神戸では、阪神淡路大震災という大きな地震がありました。

26
00:03:02,723 --> 00:03:09,756
[Host] In January of that year, a huge earthquake, the Great Hanshin-Awaji Earthquake, hit Kobe.

27
00:03:10,355 --> 00:03:12,587
[Vocab] 地震

28
00:03:12,987 --> 00:03:15,075
[Host] It means an earthquake.

29
00:03:15,675 --> 00:03:28,084
[Slow] マックは、およそ31年間、震災からの復興のシンボルとして、たくさんの人に愛されてきました。

30
00:03:28,883 --> 00:03:36,324
[Host] For about thirty-one years, Mac was loved by many people as a symbol of the city's recovery from the earthquake.

31
